# The claim grain admits a capture of the scope that owns the bare id without
# recording a claim, as before #5627. Resolve(c) records one claim per capture.
MODULE: BackupIdClaim
ROW: Resolve(c)
FILE: src/lattice.backup/BackupIdClaimGrain.cs
DETECTORS: BackupIdClaimRaceTests.Another_scope_cannot_take_an_id_its_owner_is_republishing_through_a_retire, BackupIdCollisionTests.The_owning_scope_holds_a_claim_while_it_republishes_its_id
SUMMARY: the claim grain admits the owning scope without recording a claim

--- FIND
        var claim = new BackupIdPendingClaim { ScopeKey = scopeKey, Until = now + PendingClaimLifetime };
--- REPLACE
        if (owner is not null)
        {
            return true;
        }

        var claim = new BackupIdPendingClaim { ScopeKey = scopeKey, Until = now + PendingClaimLifetime };
--- END
